### Save carrier after review (preferred)
POST {{BASE}}/api/validate/carrier/save
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "validationId": "REPLACE_WITH_VALIDATION_ID",
  "email": "carrier@example.com",
  "password": "StrongP@ssw0rd"
}

### Example success response (200) - returns LoginResponse with JWT
###
### {
###   "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."
### }

### Save broker after review (preferred)
POST {{BASE}}/api/validate/broker/save
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "validationId": "REPLACE_WITH_VALIDATION_ID",
  "email": "broker@example.com",
  "password": "Str0ngBrok3rP@ss"
}

### Example success response (200) - returns LoginResponse with JWT
### {
###   "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..."
### }

