### Login
POST {{BASE}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "carrier@example.com",
  "password": "StrongP@ssw0rd"
}

### Get current carrier (requires token)
GET {{BASE}}/api/carriers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Accept: application/json

### Get current broker (requires token)
GET {{BASE}}/api/brokers/me
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Create load (broker) — requires token
POST {{BASE}}/api/loads
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Accept: application/json

{
  "pickupStreet": "100 Logistics Way",
  "pickupCity": "Chicago",
  "pickupState": "IL",
  "pickupZip": "60601",
  "pickupCountry": "US",
  "deliveryStreet": "200 Freight Ave",
  "deliveryCity": "Los Angeles",
  "deliveryState": "CA",
  "deliveryZip": "90001",
  "deliveryCountry": "US",
  "description": "FTL - dry van",
  "weight": 12000,
  "price": 1500
}

### List broker loads (requires token)
GET {{BASE}}/api/loads
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Accept: application/json

### Place a bid or Book Now (carrier) — requires token
POST {{BASE}}/api/loads/bid
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Accept: application/json

{
  "loadId": "REPLACE_WITH_LOAD_ID",
  "amount": 1400,
  "bookNow": false
}

### Toggle subscription (admin/testing) - activate carrier subscription
POST {{BASE}}/api/subscription/activate/{{CARRIER_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Toggle subscription (admin/testing) - deactivate carrier subscription
POST {{BASE}}/api/subscription/deactivate/{{CARRIER_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

# ---- Extra/Negative checks (optional) ----

### 8) Try `/api/carriers/me` without token (should return 401/forbidden)
GET {{BASE}}/api/carriers/me

### 9) Register Carrier with lookupType DOT example
POST {{BASE}}/api/carriers/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carrier2@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "lookupValue": "987654",
  "lookupType": "DOT"
}

### 10) Login (Broker) - useful after registering a broker
POST {{BASE}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "broker@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 11) Broker register + immediate login flow (example order)
# 1) Register broker (see request 4)
# 2) Login with same broker email/password using request 10

### Example: Full carrier flow
# 1) Register carrier (request 1)
# 2) Copy token from response and set @TOKEN
# 3) GET /api/carriers/me (request 3) with Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Quick sample sequence (validate -> save -> use token)
# 1) POST /api/validate/carrier with lookup payload (see above)
#    -> receive preview response with validationId and parsed fields
# 2) Show preview to user for review
# 3) POST /api/validate/carrier/save with { validationId, email, password }
#    -> receive { "token": "<jwt>" }
# 4) Use the token for protected calls, e.g. GET /api/carriers/me
#    Authorization: Bearer <jwt>

### Example: Full broker flow
# 1) Register broker (request 4)
# 2) Login (request 10) -> set @TOKEN
# 3) POST /api/brokers/loads (request 6) with Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
